188	 * Smart dispatch — picks the best agent for a task based on:
189	 *   skill match × current load × success rate × cost tier × priority.
190	 *
191	 * Body:
192	 *   { query, taskType?, priority?, estimatedTokens?, preferredAgent?,
193	 *     dryRun?, title? }
194	 *
195	 * Returns:
196	 *   200 { ok, taskId, agentId, score, candidates } on success
197	 *   200 { ok, dryRun: true, candidates }              when dryRun=true
