299	  // 3. Filter eligibility — only active agents with capacity + proven not-broken
300	  //    successRate < 0.6 only disqualifies if the agent has enough run history
301	  //    (totalRuns >= 5) to make that signal meaningful. Brand-new agents with
302	  //    0 runs (successRate=0 by default) shouldn't be locked out forever.
